      "body_md": "JCR's current small-combat catalog covers distinct mechanical tiers: lightweight Blitz Lite for smaller brushless drive, Blitz Pro for rugged 3lb wheel drive, DartBox V2 for brushed planetary drive, and RDY/JCR hubmotors for direct weapons. The RevvitRC 50A is the current high-current AM32 weapon/controller option with an onboard servo-capable BEC, while Pariah is retained only as discontinued legacy data. For direct weapons, RDY-5735 reduces mass compared with RDY-5536 but its first-generation mechanical notes matter: JCR specifically recommends two-sided support for undercutter/overhead use."
